title: "XPU-Atlas: A Reproducible Evidence Audit of Twenty Processing-Unit Paradigms, 1971-2026"
authors:
  - family-names: "XPU-Atlas Contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-04"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - computer architecture
  - accelerators
  - evidence audit
  - reproducibility
  - bibliometrics
  - benchmarking
abstract: >-
  A verification-first taxonomy and empirical audit of twenty processing-unit
  paradigms, combining a graded claim ledger, live bibliometric, public-attention
  and market data, host microbenchmarks, and a fully containerized reproduction
  pipeline.
